## 9. Redis Usage Summary

| Purpose | Key pattern | Type |
|---|---|---|
| Balance cache | `balances:{group_id}` | STRING (JSON) |
| Pub/Sub channel | `notifications` | Redis Pub/Sub channel |

Event payload published on new expense / settlement:
```json
{ "event": "expense_created", "group_id": "...", "expense_id": "...", "actor": "..." }
```
The notification worker subscribes with `redis.pubsub()`, loops on `.listen()`, and logs a structured line per event (e.g. via `structlog`) simulating "email sent to group members."

