## 11. Docker & Local Dev

- `core-api/Dockerfile`, `notification-worker/Dockerfile` — separate, minimal (python:3.12-slim base, non-root user, multi-stage build to keep image small).
- `docker-compose.yml` at repo root spinning up: `postgres`, `redis`, `core-api`, `notification-worker`. Core API depends_on postgres+redis with healthchecks so it doesn't boot before DB is ready.
- `.env.example` documenting all required env vars (`DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL`, `JWT_SECRET`, `JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRE_MIN`, etc.) — never commit a real `.env`.

